      },
      "content": "Sealed lead acid; rechargeable; 6 V; internal"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1264",
      "reading_order": 1354,
      "section": "ELECTRICAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.959616,
        "t": 419.331192,
        "r": 243.02876399999994,
        "b": 410.13982830936226
      },
      "content": "Battery Operation:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1265",
      "reading_order": 1355,
      "section": "ELECTRICAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 251.999736,
        "t": 418.92283199999997,
        "r": 539.9781959999998,
        "b": 387.1672170491803
      },
      "content": "A fully charged new battery provides approximately three hours  of  operation  at  125  mL/hr,  or  delivers  250  mL if > 126 mL/hr."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1266",
      "reading_order": 1356,
      "section": "ELECTRICAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 251.99973600000004,
        "t": 373.14268799999996,
        "r": 539.9433360000002,
        "b": 352.84704904918027
      },
      "content": "Operation  time  is  measured  from  initial  pumping  to  the Depleted Battery alarm."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1267",
      "reading_order": 1357,
      "section": "ELECTRICAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 251.999736,
        "t": 338.82251999999994,
        "r": 539.9552880000005,
        "b": 307.06690504918026
      },
      "content": "The infuser should be operated on battery power for three continuous  hours  every  six  months  for  optimum performance and battery life."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1268",
      "reading_order": 1358,
      "section": "ELECTRICAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 190.79952,
        "t": 298.910808,
        "r": 243.0198,
        "b": 289.71944430936225
      },
      "content": "Recharge:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1269",
      "reading_order": 1359,
      "section": "ELECTRICAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 251.999736,
        "t": 298.50244799999996,
        "r": 540.044928000001,
        "b": 278.1470490491803
      },
      "content": "The  battery  charges  whenever  the  infuser  is  connected to AC power."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1270",
      "reading_order": 1360,
      "section": "ELECTRICAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 251.999736,
        "t": 264.18228,
        "r": 539.9134560000006,
        "b": 243.82688104918032
      },
      "content": "If the infuser is operating at 125 mL/hr on one line, a full recharge takes approximately six hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1271",
      "reading_order": 1361,
      "section": "ELECTRICAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 164.52006,
        "t": 235.97057999999993,
        "r": 243.02677200000002,
        "b": 226.77921630936225
      },
      "content": "Self-Discharge:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1272",
      "reading_order": 1362,
      "section": "ELECTRICAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 251.99973599999998,
        "t": 235.56222000000002,
        "r": 539.9483160000009,
        "b": 215.20682104918023
      },
      "content": "50 % of charge is retained for a minimum of one month when the infuser is not connected to AC power or is not operating."
    },
